Formation & Lineup Planner

This module replaces the old standalone Lovable “Field Hockey Position Planner” prototype and turns it into a real SportStack feature using Supabase, the existing SportStack admin UI style, and existing team/player data.

Important: do not build this as a separate dark green single-file prototype. It must fit into the current SportStack admin layout: blue sidebar, white cards, clean admin dashboard styling, top selectors, role-based access, and existing Supabase patterns.

Core outcome:

Admins and coaches should be able to create reusable formation templates, then use those templates to assign real eligible players into a team or match lineup.

The module has two connected but separate parts:

1. Formation Builder

   * Used to create reusable visual formation templates.
   * Lives in the admin/settings area or as a “Formations” admin sidebar page.

2. Lineup Selection

   * Used to assign real players to a selected formation.
   * Lives in a team or fixture/match context.

These should be designed together because they share the same database structure, but keep the UI responsibilities separate.

