### Club Admin

Can manage formations/defaults within their club scope.
Can view inherited Association and Super formations.
Can manage lineups for teams in their club if existing permissions allow.

### Team Coach / Manager

Can create team-level formations for their team.
Can set a team-level default.
Can view inherited Club / Association / Super formations.
Can create and edit lineups for their team.

Do not invent a new permissions system if helpers already exist.
Reuse existing auth, role, organisation, association, club, and team permission logic.

